<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: Brew an already acidic coffee garnished with a wedge of more acidic lemon, meant to be juiced into the coffee before quickly consumed while hot. An acquired taste to be sure but lauded by those who do prefer it.-->
  <VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.description>冲泡一杯已经呈酸性的咖啡，饰以一片酸性更强的柠檬，在热期间快速饮用之前，将其榨汁到咖啡中。当然，这是一种后天习得的品味，但也受到那些喜欢它的人的称赞。</VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.description>
  <!--EN: Brewing espresso romano.-->
  <VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.jobString>酿造罗马浓缩咖啡。</VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.jobString>
  <!--EN: brew espresso romano-->
  <VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.label>酿造罗马浓缩咖啡</VBE_BrewLemonCoffee.label>
  <!--EN: Make a very strong and semi-sweet fruity tea. Floral notes dance around one's pallet at even the most dull scent. People who finish the drink feel strangely urged to colonize.-->
  <VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.description>制作非常浓的半甜果味茶。即使是最沉闷的香味，花香也会在人的托盘中翩翩起舞。喝完酒的人会奇怪地感到想要殖民。</VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.description>
  <!--EN: Making earl grey tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.jobString>制作伯爵茶。</VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.jobString>
  <!--EN: make earl grey tea-->
  <VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.label>制作伯爵茶</VBE_MakeEarlGreyTea.label>
  <!--EN: Make a dark tea cut with water, chilled and garnished with a wedge of bright lemon.-->
  <VBE_MakeLemonTea.description>用水冲泡一杯黑茶，冷却并用一片鲜柠檬装饰。</VBE_MakeLemonTea.description>
  <!--EN: Making lemon tea.-->
  <VBE_MakeLemonTea.jobString>制作柠檬茶。</VBE_MakeLemonTea.jobString>
  <!--EN: make lemon tea-->
  <VBE_MakeLemonTea.label>泡柠檬茶</VBE_MakeLemonTea.label>
  <!--EN: Squeeze a few lemons, mix the juice with water and add some sugar.-->
  <VBE_MixLemonade.description>挤一些柠檬，将汁与水混合，然后加入一些糖。</VBE_MixLemonade.description>
  <!--EN: Mixing lemonade.-->
  <VBE_MixLemonade.jobString>混合柠檬水。</VBE_MixLemonade.jobString>
  <!--EN: mix lemonade-->
  <VBE_MixLemonade.label>混合柠檬水</VBE_MixLemonade.label>
</LanguageData>
